From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Select original clipped text polygons and GX scissor material
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Connect the existing float-UV writer, glAttachPoly2 scissorbox overload and
original GXScissoredVertexColourTextureMaterialProgram. Preserve the original
quad order, texture binding, TEV recipe, scissor coordinates and reset. Adapt
FIFO/cache operations to Aurora and preserve four-byte material array cells
on LP64. Add bounded native frame/array ownership and registry cleanup. The
console branches, text visibility and Credits scrolling rules are unchanged.
Polygon restrictions require MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_POLYGONS; complete original
glDraw2 keeps untextured/utility paths. Generic parameter providers remain open.

